 john wick and keanu reeves are at least  very familiar with berlin  because while the baba yaga has business  matters to take care of the german  capital  keanu also lived there for a few months  during the shooting of matrix iv  what is entirely new about john wake  four and five is that creator derek  colstad will  no longer be part of it michael finch  has already been taking over his duties  for several months and he's in complete  charge of the screenplay  at the very least the well-known face  will once again take the director's  chair namely director  chad stehalski furthermore there is to  announce that the previously planned  double shooting of parks 405  is now history instead john week 4 will  be shot this summer while john wick 5  will be shot at a much later date  perhaps due to the pandemic  fans shouldn't worry too much about part  5 though because according to our  sources the film  is still on track john wick's presumed  vengeance after the end of part 3 can  hopefully seen  in may 2022  the quality of the resident evil movies  released so far is debatable  either you celebrate the action-packed  blockbusters or you miss the horror  factor and the thematic relevance to the  movie game originals director johannes  roberts has now  announced the official title of the  reboot which is based on the two highly  praised first parts of the video game  franchise to be resident evil  welcome to raccoon city in terms of  content the new project will finally put  the past films and the milo djokovic  behind  and return to its origins director  roberts who has been in the director's  chair for 47 meters down and the  strangers too amongst other projects  seems best suited for the job we can  only hope that the 44 year old succeeds  in making a fresh start and that he'll  be able to recreate the dark rainy  atmosphere of the two video games on  film  the international release date for  resident evil welcome to raccoon city is  scheduled for september 3rd  2021 